<h1>Legend</h1>
<p>Symbol taxonomy based on my writing on
  <a href="https://brennan.day/blogging-with-magic-unicode-simple-doesnt-have-to-mean-boring/">ASCII characters</a>.</p>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Symbol</th>
      <th>Type</th>
      <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>
        <span class="sym sym--quote">&gt;</span>
      </td>
      <td>Quote</td>
      <td>Passages worth remembering</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        <span class="sym sym--bookmark">⚹</span>
      </td>
      <td>Bookmark</td>
      <td>Links to external resources</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        <span class="sym sym--note">●</span>
      </td>
      <td>Note</td>
      <td>Longer-form ideas and concepts</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        <span class="sym sym--diary">🜁</span>
      </td>
      <td>Diary</td>
      <td>Personal logs and reflections</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        <span class="sym sym--snippet">🜃</span>
      </td>
      <td>Snippet</td>
      <td>Code and technical notes</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        <span class="sym sym--stub">☉</span>
      </td>
      <td>Stub</td>
      <td>Placeholder pages for future development</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>